# Integrity Copilot — Meta AI Developer Hackathon build. Meta models only; no other provider exists here.

# ── Meta models ──
# INTEGRITY_COPILOT_LIVE=1 turns on the narrative from local Meta Muse (muse-glimmer via the Ollama
# desktop runtime on loopback; no key, no cost).
# Paid Meta API calls are a separate opt-in: INTEGRITY_COPILOT_MUSE=api (Muse Spark narrative) or
# INTEGRITY_COPILOT_SAM=live (live SAM 3.1). Only then is MODEL_API_KEY used.
# MODEL_API_KEY=...
# INTEGRITY_COPILOT_LIVE=1

# ── Process-wide spend ceiling (configurable downward only; defaults 400 calls / $25) ──
# INTEGRITY_COPILOT_MAX_CALLS=400
# INTEGRITY_COPILOT_MAX_USD=25

# ── Engineer approval / live-replay gate (required for decisions and live replay) ──
# Generate with: openssl rand -hex 32
# INTEGRITY_COPILOT_APPROVER_TOKEN=...
